{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791945300, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T02:35:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T02:36:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791945360, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:35:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 63822, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "希望忠孝西路一段可以全天候開放機車通行，減緩市民大道和長安東路的壓力", "display_name": "中正代表 No.63,822", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:35:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 63823, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "育兒", "content": "希望可以增加好孕專車的搭車金額，現在是8000，但增加金額必須經過精密計算方式，不能被濫用", "display_name": "信義代表 No.63,823", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:35:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 63824, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "醫療", "content": "我想了解，如何改善目前醫療的人力缺乏問題，有何改善方案，雖然目前有增加考照率，改善不佳", "display_name": "大安代表 No.63,824", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:35:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 63825, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "育兒", "content": "增加臨時托育的場所（請保母來家裡會覺得怪怪），但要確保是安心安全的場所", "display_name": "士林代表 Joey Hsu", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:35:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 63826, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "治安", "content": "媽媽昨天去戶政事務所辦事，今早就收到詐騙電話，市政機關的資訊安全堪慮，希望未來市長能注意。", "display_name": "松山代表 Al Chen 艾倫 ⌤", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 63823, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.63,823", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 63824, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.63,824", "district": "daan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 63825